<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#1C6F38">
    <title>Password Reset Code</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background-color: #F8FAF8;
            color: #282B36;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        .page {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 40px 16px;
            background-color: #F8FAF8;
            background-image:
                radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 55% at 50% -10%, rgba(79, 174, 104, 0.22), transparent 55%),
                radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 40% at 100% 100%, rgba(28, 111, 56, 0.12), transparent 50%);
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 560px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 16px;
            border: 1px solid #DCEFE2;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(28, 111, 56, 0.08);
        }

        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1C6F38 0%, #124E2A 100%);
            padding: 28px 32px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .logo {
            max-width: 140px;
            max-height: 56px;
            display: block;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .brand {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .body {
            padding: 36px 32px 28px;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 0 0 8px;
            color: #124E2A;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        .subtitle {
            margin: 0 0 28px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #585858;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .greeting {
            font-size: 15px;
            margin: 0 0 16px;
            color: #282B36;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.65;
            margin: 0 0 16px;
            color: #585858;
        }

        .code-container {
            margin: 28px 0;
            padding: 24px 16px;
            background-color: #DCEFE2;
            border: 1.5px dashed #4FAE68;
            border-radius: 12px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .code-label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #1C6F38;
        }

        .code {
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 36px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1C6F38;
            letter-spacing: 8px;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .note {
            margin: 0 0 20px;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            background-color: #F8FAF8;
            border-left: 3px solid #4FAE68;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.55;
            color: #585858;
        }

        .signoff {
            margin: 24px 0 0;
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #282B36;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .signoff strong {
            color: #1C6F38;
        }

        .footer {
            padding: 20px 32px 28px;
            border-top: 1px solid #DCEFE2;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #9CA3AF;
        }

        .footer a {
            color: #1C6F38;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="page">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header">
                <% if (logo_url) { %>
                    <img src="<%= logo_url %>" alt="<%= app_name %> Logo" class="logo">
                <% } else { %>
                    <p class="brand"><%= app_name %></p>
                <% } %>
            </div>

            <div class="body">
                <h1>Password Reset Code</h1>
                <p class="subtitle">Use this code to securely reset your password</p>

                <p class="greeting">Hello <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>

                <p>You requested to reset your password. Enter the verification code below in the app to continue:</p>

                <div class="code-container">
                    <span class="code-label">Verification Code</span>
                    <span class="code"><%= verification_code %></span>
                </div>

                <p class="note">This code is valid for a limited time. If you did not request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email.</p>

                <p class="signoff">
                    Thank you,<br>
                    The <strong><%= app_name %></strong> Team
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="footer">
                &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> <%= app_name %>. All rights reserved.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>
